WEBVTT

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.350
I see.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.030
You're returning to Azuchi.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.090
It would, indeed, be difficult 
to travel there at night.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.920
Please come inside.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.130
Thanks.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.300
I appreciate it.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.630
<b>Honnouji</b>

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.630
Honnouji?

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.830
Hmm...

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.010
I'm pretty sure I've heard 
that name somewhere before...

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.060
"The year 1582...

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.030
Just before completing his conquest of Japan,

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:10.020
Oda Nobunaga was betrayed by his retainer,

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.300
Akechi Mitsuhide, at Honnouji, in Kyoto..."

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.650
No way!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.160
"...betrayed by his retainer, Akechi Mitsuhide,

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.410
at Honnouji, in Kyoto, and slain."

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:27.910
"This is known as the Honnouji Incident."

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:29.750
My lord,

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.920
first you should wash off the journey's sweat.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.680
Here is a change of clothes for you.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:34.550
Yeah.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.050
Hideyoshi, you want to join me?

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:41.970
I have to help get dinner ready...

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.330
Oh, yeah?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.970
That's no fun...

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.600
Then, Mitsuhide, you'll join me, right?

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.830
I'll be tending to the bath's fire.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.600
Take your time.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.200
I see.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.270
See you in a bit, then.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.170
<i>There wasn't anything unusual</i>

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.570
<i>about that, was there?</i>

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.000
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.830
<i>It's always been that way.</i>

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.310
<i>Things won't happen like they did in the textbook!</i>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.720
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.720
<b>Double Suicide Maiden</b>

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:27.710
My lord.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.270
How is the bath?

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.370
Perfect.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.410
This is paradise.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.020
I'm glad to hear it.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:49.280
<i>I've served my lord for as long as I can remember.</i>

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.600
<i>I've given her my whole life, and more.</i>

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:59.550
<i>But... If she still doesn't 
realize how I feel, then...</i>

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:05.350
I should kill her myself, and then I...

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.100
Kill?

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.100
Someone's in a bad mood.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.940
What's wrong, Mitsuhide?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.550
Did something happen?

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.480
N-Not at all.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.470
I'm terribly sorry, my lord.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.490
I've run out of wood.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.730
I'll go get more.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.490
Very well.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.450
All right.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.910
What are you doing here, Masamune-dono?

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.740
Actually, could you simply forget what you heard?

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.210
What I heard?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.530
They were meaningless words. 
I was talking to myself.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.500
Please forget them.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:46.800
<i>Nobunaga-san got sick of you!</i>

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.800
<i>You've been dumped.</i>

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.360
<i>I guess you're still...</i>

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.880
Apologies, Masamune-dono. I must return.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:02.690
So, just who do you plan to kill?

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.530
Hideyoshi-dono?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.970
Or perhaps Nobuna—

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.030
Masamune-dono!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.860
Even should you be imagining such a thing,

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.580
it can't be helped.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:17.120
I've recognized your loyalty, more than anyone.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.560
You've traveled the length and breadth of the land,

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:24.650
searching for the Crimson Armor, 
gathering information, and offering it to her.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.590
Your daily training and studies...

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.600
All for Nobunaga-dono, as well, yes?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:36.440
And yet, of late, she seems 
enthralled by Hideyoshi-dono.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.360
She prefers useless little Hideyoshi-dono to you.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.360
Now, you'll have nothing left.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.860
So I can see where you might get certain ideas.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.870
No, I'm certain I'd think the same thing.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.410
Do not hesitate!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.700
You feel this way because 
your love is deep and true.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.410
That is what a woman's love means.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.550
You should put it to the test.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.220
Test what?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.150
The bond between you and Nobunaga-dono.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:16.140
If that bond is true, then nothing should

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.430
prevent your feelings from reaching her.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.410
What is this?

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.470
Sake.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.660
But much stronger than usual.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.660
It would be enough to 
put anyone to sleep instantly.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.970
How you use it is up to you.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.120
You may drink it along with Nobunaga-dono,

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.550
or if you prefer,

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.090
drink it yourself and enjoy the night's dreams.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.240
The choice is yours.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.890
Are you prepared to risk your life to know?

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:13.450
Um... What, exactly, is going on here?

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.400
Akerin?

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:17.820
Hey, why are you doing this?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.550
Akerin!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.320
This is a wager.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:24.420
A wager to determine my fate and my lord's.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.880
A wager? Fate?

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.730
Wait! Akerin!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.630
I don't understand what you're saying!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.970
Akerin!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.680
Akerin...

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.640
She can't be...

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.640
The Honnouji Incident?

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.770
No, you can't do it!

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:44.020
Untie me!

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.820
It's no use... I can't do it.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.800
Someone untie me!

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:56.870
Come to think of it,

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.100
why am I the one always tied up?

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.830
It's quiet...

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:09.060
Where are the temple priestesses?

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.940
They retired to the other building.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.430
I tried to refuse,

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.190
but they said that a quiet evening

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:17.350
would best ease the exhaustion of our journey.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.350
Hmm... I'll have to apologize for that.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:24.070
But I couldn't refuse their kindness.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:24.600
What's that?

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.860
Someone from a nearby village offered it for you.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:32.640
I took it, thinking it would be a good way

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.370
to celebrate our having gathered all the armor.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:35.360
I see.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.030
What's wrong?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.120
Why are you so quiet?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.580
We've finally collected all the armor.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.460
Much has happened along the way.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.840
I've burdened you a lot.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.030
Not at all, thank you.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.850
Come to think of it, where's Hideyoshi?

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:07.650
She didn't go to the other building, too, did she?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.260
Hideyoshi is preparing some food

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:12.210
to go with the sake.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.850
She insisted on doing it alone,

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:16.500
so I came to keep you company.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:17.870
So that's it.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:19.950
Yes.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.950
Now, my lord... Drink up.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.410
Thanks.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.220
This is good!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:32.420
You have some, too!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.310
I made a vow

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:37.810
not to celebrate until you've succeeded

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.730
in unifying the land.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.390
You're as serious as ever.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.150
Here, have another.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:44.850
Thanks.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.980
No one's coming...

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.110
{fad(1,137)}Growl

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.920
I'm hungry!

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.130
Huh? They got looser.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.040
Growly

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.250
Did they fall off, now that I'm hungry?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.580
Oh, whatever!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.240
I need to stop Akerin!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.650
Damn it.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:18.440
I've served you for so long.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.200
My lord...

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:25.280
Mitsuhide will be with you forever.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.560
My lord...

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.990
I shall follow you soon.

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:57.150
Wait!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:06.410
Akerin...

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:15.990
Akerin...

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.520
Hideyoshi.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:18.630
How did you escape those ropes?

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:22.070
Did you do this?

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.390
It has nothing to do with you!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.680
Did you kill our lord?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.770
Answer me!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:34.700
Akerin!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.020
She's just asleep.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.600
That's enough, right?

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:41.530
Go.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.200
Go!

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:47.180
No!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.270
What?

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.890
There's still time!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.340
We can still stop this!

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:53.380
Why did you do this?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:53.940
Why?

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.110
Don't you dare ask me that!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.510
Ever since you...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.930
Ever since you showed up!

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.850
I was happy when we were alone.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.820
She cared only for me,

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.810
smiled only at me.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.810
And now...

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.780
You've come between us and stolen

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.990
the only thing I've ever wanted!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:36.210
So at least allow me to meet my end by her side.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.490
No... No! That's wrong!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.340
What?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.210
If I came between you, I'm sorry!

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:48.730
But that's no reason to kill her!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.170
How dare you even speak...

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.520
Is it OK with you, never seeing her laugh again?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.220
Is it OK with you not to laugh with her?

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.590
It's not OK with me!

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:57.510
You...

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:59.970
You love her, right?

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.320
Can you only love her as

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.400
the sole person she cares for?

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.540
Akerin!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:08.970
Whatever!

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.370
She's interfering.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.730
My lord! My lord!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.760
Damn it...

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.220
Hideyoshi, where did you go?

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.980
At this rate, I'll...

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.380
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.150
I was planning on dying here, 
too, until a minute ago.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.670
<i>That's wrong!</i>

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.140
<i>Is it OK with you, never seeing her laugh again?</i>

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.400
<i>Can you only love her as</i>

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.530
<i>the sole person she cares for?</i>

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.800
I...

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.670
Mitsuhide!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.050
Where's the enemy?!

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:20.810
The enemy?

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.320
My lord's enemy...

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.320
Mitsuhide!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.070
What's wrong? Mitsuhide!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:37.290
The enemy is at Honnouji...

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:43.040
Inside my heart...

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:49.420
I am terribly sorry, my lord!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.390
I am a traitor, unworthy of being your retainer!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.240
Please run away!

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.560
I will pay for this sin with my life!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.660
My lord...

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.060
Read this.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.030
Read it!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.190
"Conquest"...

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.290
Indeed! Conquest!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.460
Don't you dare, Mitsuhide...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.900
My dream of conquest

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.280
would have never begun without you.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.940
Don't you dare say anything so stupid,

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.120
not when we're so close to reaching it!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.970
I'm dragging you out of here, 
whether you like it or not.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.010
Got it?

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:40.430
Yes...

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.730
You and I are one.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.690
That will never change.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:54.000
I-I'm so happy...

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.210
How awful.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.580
<i>Cruel blade!</i>

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.320
You're safe?

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.330
Priestess, take a look at Mitsuhide!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.550
She's not breathing!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:16.090
She probably took in too much smoke.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.930
What do we do?

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.970
First, I'll make her some medicine,

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.670
and then we'll wash her throat out.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:24.260
There isn't time!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.270
We just need to make her breathe, right?

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.980
That's... That's true.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.170
Mitsuhide, don't die!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:40.750
Mitsuhide!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.400
Mitsuhide!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>What...</i>

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:51.860
<i>What is this warm, happy feeling?</i>

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.330
<i>My lord is...</i>

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.580
<i>My lord is kissing me.</i>

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:12.450
<i>May this happy moment last as long as possible...</i>

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:16.910
Her face looks much better.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:18.810
I see.

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:19.370
Mitsuhide!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:20.860
Mitsuhide!

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:24.800
Mitsuhide...

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:27.870
My lord.

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.380
You made me worry, you fool.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:36.260
My lord.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:39.150
By the way, where's the other one?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:44.310
My lord!

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.860
Where are you?

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.110
I can't breathe...

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.820
But I have to find her.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:57.600
My lord!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.200
Masamune-san...

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:06.910
Where are you taking that...

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.160
Hide-san!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.070
Hide-san?

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:19.780
Hide-san!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.720
<i>Date-sensei...</i>

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:35.730
<i>She just called me Hide-san...</i>

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.780
You're awake?

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:48.040
Hideyoshi-sama has awakened.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:50.540
Where am I...

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.800
You should stay down.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.540
Hideyoshi, how do you feel?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.800
I still feel a little out of it.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.540
Why am I...

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.310
You were unconscious outside the temple.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:10.600
I'm glad you're safe.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.570
Rest some more.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:19.560
Hideyoshi... Forgive me for last night.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:22.110
Something was wrong with me.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:25.570
I'll never do anything like that again.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.270
Akerin...

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:30.070
But... You got one time.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:33.330
I got twelve!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:33.960
Huh?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.870
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:43.280
<i>Akerin seems to have changed her mind,</i>

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:45.260
<i>so all's well that ends well.</i>

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:50.220
<i>But I think I'm forgetting something important...</i>

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.880
What is she doing?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.950
Searching.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:01.070
It seems the Crimson Armor is under there.

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.360
The Crimson Armor...

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.910
What's wrong, Hideyoshi?

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.670
Why?

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.170
Why what?

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:22.420
Masamune-san might be Date-sensei!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.260
I did it! I did it!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:28.360
Now, once I get the armor to Azuchi Castle,

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.010
the Date clan's long-cherished desire...

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:33.020
Nice job, for a hick samurai from Oushuu.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.150
Hand that over.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:43.120
It won't do you any good.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:44.900
Ieyasu-dono...

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.070
I'm going to conquer this land.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:49.910
And I'll start...

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:53.290
by killing you.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.800
<b>Date-Sensei 
Hirata Yuka</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:52.410
<b>Sengoku Otome Style Preview</b>

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.890
Let's say, hypothetically,

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:31.030
we were thieves who could steal anything we wanted.

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:33.240
What would you want to steal?

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:36.430
<b>Hideyoshino 
Hidaka Rina</b>

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.610
Let me see...

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:37.080
An amusement park!

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:37.910
An amusement park?

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:38.970
From the manager.

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:39.880
The manager?

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.880
Amusement parks have managers?

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:42.620
Yes, that's right.

00:23:42.620 --> 00:23:44.540
I'll steal it from the manager.

00:23:44.540 --> 00:23:46.210
And then I could play any time I wanted.

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:48.010
And ride the roller coaster whenever I wanted.

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:49.450
That sounds fun.

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:51.550
But what would you do after you stole it?

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:52.410
After I stole it, I would...

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.480
Preview

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.480
Thief Maiden

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.490
Watch next time, OK?
